{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CfryoEg8neKsxYmDvifEz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The root cause was in `invoice_total`, and it's fixed. The full suite now passes: 5 tests, including 2 new regression tests.\n\n**Root cause:** `invoice_total` computed the discount on the unrounded line amounts, subtracted that from the gross, and rounded only once. The PDF renders `line_totals()`, which rounds each line separately. When two lines round in the same direction, the printed lines and the charged total disagree by a cent. Example: two lines of 0.25 at 50% off. Each prints as 0.13 (0.125 rounds half-up), so the PDF sums to 0.26. The old total was 0.25.\n\n**Fix** (`billing/totals.py`): `invoice_total` now sums the rounded `line_totals()` and applies tax to that sum, so the charged total always matches the printed lines. The signatures and the `__init__` exports are unchanged, so the public API is the same. I did not touch the other billing modules.\n\n**Regression tests** (`tests/test_billing.py`):\n- `test_total_matches_sum_of_printed_lines_with_discounts`: checks the total is 0.26, matching the printed lines.\n- `test_total_matches_sum_of_printed_lines_with_discounts_and_tax`: the same case with 19% tax, expecting 0.31 (the old code gives 0.30).\n\nI confirmed both new tests fail against the original `totals.py` and pass with the fix.\n\n**Notes:**\n- The ticket says the bug shows up about one invoice in twenty, and I haven't checked the fix against production data. The reproduction is the two-line 50% case above.\n- `git status` shows tracked `.pyc` files under `__pycache__` modified by running pytest. I left them alone and haven't committed anything, since you didn't ask for a commit. If you want one, I'd suggest committing only the two `.py` files."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9083,"cache_read_input_tokens":44660,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":9083},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e3b21225-cf05-4622-9fd0-c65e498635c9","uuid":"a8219945-f09d-4ace-a2fb-b8e98d547449","timestamp":"2026-10-09T16:29:25.223Z","request_id":"req_011CfryoEQknjRTQjMcqRHVD"}
